        "description": "Scenario 13 is a database check. After the DEL-BOM alert from scenario 6 has been picked up by Celery Beat (up to 60 seconds), verify in PGAdmin / the DB client:\n\nSELECT id, alert_id, triggered_price, message, notified_at FROM pulse_notificationlog;\nSELECT id, origin, destination, threshold_price, status FROM pulse_pricealert;\n\nExpected: at least one row in pulse_notificationlog and the DEL-BOM alert has status 'triggered'. This request shows the same thing through the API: total_notifications should be greater than 0 once Celery has fired."
